<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-WINDIES 62-3 V INDIA - LUNCH, 4TH TEST, 4TH DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WINDIES 62-3 V INDIA - LUNCH, 4TH TEST, 4TH DAY.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies were 62 for three at lunch on the fourth day of the fourth test against India at the Recreation Ground on Monday.</p>
<p>Score: West Indies 62-3 v India.</p>
</text>
